      "topicSlug": "finding-your-calling",
      "title": "Seeking the Path of Calling",
      "subtitle": "A 5-day guided journey for the one who is asking, “What am I meant to do with this life?”",
      "goal": "Calling does not always arrive with dramatic clarity. More often it becomes visible slowly, through confusion, prayer, and obedience. In these five days, we will face the anxiety of not seeing the road ahead, learn to rest in God’s purposes, speak honestly about our sense of inadequacy, notice what God has already placed in our hands, and gather courage for the next step.",
